Files in backend/data/real/dg_mdu/ (REAL data) are an extract of:

  "Indian Railway Operations and Delay Dataset - September 2024"
  Koyena Chowdhury, Paramita Koley, Abhijnan Chakraborty, Saptarshi Ghosh
  https://github.com/KoyenaChowdhury/RSTGCN  (zip: Indian-Railway-Network-and-Delays.zip)
  https://datahubkgp.org/datasets/79deb8a0a7d361bb4f27
  Paper: "RSTGCN: Railway-centric Spatio-Temporal Graph Convolutional Network for Train
  Delay Prediction", IEEE Transactions on Intelligent Transportation Systems (2026),
  doi:10.1109/TITS.2026.3726308; arXiv:2510.01262.

