  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
  (licence as stated on the DataHub KGP listing; the GitHub repository has no LICENSE file;
  checked 2026-11-15)

Changes made: rows restricted to the Dindigul (DG) -> Madurai (MDU) corridor and to regular
trains; times unrolled across midnight; signed delays recomputed; passing times at stations
a train does not list are ESTIMATED by km interpolation; station chainages from the Southern
Railway Madurai division map 2024 (DG DERIVED). These derived files are shared under the same
licence, CC BY-SA 4.0.

The dataset authors collected the data from https://runningstatus.in/ (a third-party running
status website). RailOpt AI did not scrape any website.
